; MIDASTOUCH — LV arm preset, INTERIM TP amendment (MidastouchAI_LV_TP15_M15_gold.set)
; ============================================================================
; STAGED 2026-09-18 (register §2b P6 build block) — DO NOT SPLICE ONTO THE
; LV CHART until the 2026-10-01 reading passes. This file is the COMPLETE
; post-amendment LV configuration, held ready so deployment is a splice,
; not an edit session.
;
; Change vs MidastouchAI_LV_gold.set: InpTpMult 2.0 -> 1.5 (ONE key).
; Evidence (midas_p6_income_study_20260918.json, register P6 row): on the
; current M15 config the median day declines monotonically with TP length
; (1.0R +$4.29, 1.5R +$2.91, 1.8R -$2.48, 2.0R -$2.50) — the live 2.0R
; shape is the worst daily-income shape measured. 1.5R chosen over 1.0R
; because 1.0R missed the M5 OOS pf gate (1.138 < 1.15) while 1.5R
; survived it (pf 1.150).
; Everything else — mode 0 ORIGINAL, k=1.0/75-25 trigger, session 06-20
; UTC, SL 2xATR(H1), 720-min timeout, risk 1%, InpMaxRiskPct 15,
; spread cap 1.5%-of-stop, daily breaker 15%, Friday cutoff/flat 20:00 —
; is IDENTICAL to the live file. Requires EA >= v1.19 (P6 build block);
; v1.16 binaries ignore InpEntryTF (absent here = default M15 anyway).
InpMagic=7801601
InpArmTag=LV
InpMode=0
InpMacroEmaPeriod=20
InpBBPeriod=20
; Trigger: the 2026-09-18 LV amendment (k=1.0/75-25) — unchanged here.
InpBBDev=1.0
InpRSIPeriod=14
InpRSIUpper=75.0
InpRSILower=25.0
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpSlAtrMult=2.0
; THE AMENDMENT: TP 1.5R (P6 interim SIA item, post-reading).
InpTpMult=1.5
InpTimeoutMinutes=720
InpSessionStartHour=6
InpSessionEndHour=20
InpSpreadCapPctStop=1.5
InpFridayCutoffHour=20
InpUseNewsFilter=false
InpStaleMinutes=30
InpRiskPercent=1.0
InpMaxRiskPct=15.0
; 2026-09-20 NEUTRALISED: this key was TRUE (the Deriv-era LV arm). The Deriv account
; is closed, MT5 now points at a funded $25,000 Upcomers evaluation, and no gold
; signal has passed the walk-forward gate — so a preset that can send real orders is
; a loaded switch, not a record. What happened under the live setting lives in the
; ledgers and the commit history, not in this line. Restoring it is a frozen-gate
; event, not an edit.
;   was: InpLiveExecution=true
InpLiveExecution=false
InpPaperEquity=50.0
InpDeviationPoints=20
InpOrderRetries=3
InpFridayFlatHour=20
; Daily breaker: the LV registered 15.0 (paper arms keep 3.0).
InpDailyLossCapPct=15.0
; Entry TF: M15 (explicit = the certified engine; the M5 step is the other file).
InpEntryTF=15
InpBarModel=false
InpSpreadFile=MIDASTOUCH_spread_M15.csv
InpWindowStart=0
InpWindowEnd=0
